              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Count छह to दस, then ग्यारह to बीस, and by tens सत्तर, अस्सी, नब्बे. Which one is one less than twenty? (उन्नीस.)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: संतरा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संतरा — santarā — \"an orange\"."
            }
